{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows从可疑路径打开RDP文件。对应需求：初始访问。官方：Remote Desktop File Opened from Suspicious Path。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows从可疑路径打开RDP文件","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows从可疑路径打开RDP文件\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2024/10/29/midnight-blizzard-conducts-large-scale-spear-phishing-campaign-using-rdp-files/","https://www.blackhillsinfosec.com/rogue-rdp-revisiting-initial-access-methods/","https://shorsec.io/blog/malrdp-implementing-rouge-rdp-manually/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"f401a0e3-5eeb-4591-969a-f435488e7d12","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n process.name : \"mstsc.exe\" and\n process.args : (\"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\Downloads\\\\*.rdp\",\n                 \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\Temp?_*.rdp\",\n                 \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\7z*.rdp\",\n                 \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\Rar$*\\\\*.rdp\",\n                 \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\BNZ.*.rdp\",\n                 \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\INetCache\\\\Content.Outlook\\\\*.rdp\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1566","name":"Phishing","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1566.001","name":"Spearphishing Attachment","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1204.002","name":"Malicious File","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":10,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
